<title>POLAND: Polish parliament adopts 7-pct construction VAT.</title>
<headline>Polish parliament adopts 7-pct construction VAT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's lower house of parliament on Thursday approved a bill keeping the preferential seven percent value added tax rate for construction materials and services until the year 2000, PAP news agency said.</p>
<p>The bill, which still needs to clear the senate and be signed by the president is designed to stimulate housing construction.</p>
<p>Poland's regular VAT rate is 22 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
